WEBVTT

00:03:26.516 --> 00:03:32.116
we saw the seaweed
that was harvested three years prior

00:03:32.156 --> 00:03:35.636
reduce emissions by over 80 percent.

00:03:36.436 --> 00:03:41.076
(Applause)

00:03:41.116 --> 00:03:42.916
Our colleagues in Australia,

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:47.356
they saw up to 98 percent
reduction in a similar trial.

00:03:47.676 --> 00:03:50.636
That kind of reduction
is simply staggering.

00:03:51.996 --> 00:03:53.436
And in the graph,

00:03:53.436 --> 00:03:58.876
you see methane emissions
in three levels of intake.

00:03:58.876 --> 00:04:02.116
So the first line
is for cattle with no seaweed,